    "$type": "Markdown",
    "value": "# Two-Day Mysore Escape from Bengaluru"
  },
  {
    "$type": "Markdown",
    "value": "## Overall flow\n- A balanced itinerary exploring historical temples, vibrant gardens, and iconic royal landmarks.\n- The trip combines heritage sightseeing with leisurely nature walks, ensuring a relaxed pace for your journey from Bengaluru.\n\n## Course highlights\n- Discover architectural marvels like the Mysore Palace and the historic Sri Ranganathaswamy Temple.\n- Experience scenic beauty and wildlife at Brindavan Gardens and the Mysore Zoo, complemented by a comfortable stay in the city. [1][2][3]"
